                                "sense_id": "4c1514d1-c719-342f-840b-22cfef51ef78",
                                "text": "Contrast these two tribes with their neighbours of the south and west—with the Ugrians of the leveller country and the alluvial soils on the Viatka and Kama, and we see the difference between a life of agriculture and a life of venatorial activity"
                            },
